oduction (`letsencrypt_staging: false`) to issue the final certificate and deploy.","thinking":"**Refactoring Domain Zone Handling**\n\nIdentified that domain zone handling in both scripts relies on `CERTBOT_DOMAIN`. This is inflexible. Proposing a `PDNS_ZONE` variable for improved flexibility.\n\nInitial plan is to modify the `zone` variable assignment to use `PDNS_ZONE` with a default, ensuring robustness with a final cleanup step. This will make the process bulletproof.\n\n\n"}
